{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the Project DINOZ Demo</strong>, you play as <strong>Delta</strong>, one of the last surviving members of a recon squad sent to investigate a blackout on a remote island research facility. With her team gone, she\u2019s tasked with a solo objective: infiltrate an underground lab and retrieve a laptop containing critical data.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The facility is abandoned. The jungle is silent. But she\u2019s not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a focused 2 km\u00b2 slice of the island\u2014including derelict outposts, dense jungle paths, and a short underground segment filled with tension and isolation. Intelligent predators roam the area, stalking the last remnants of the mission\u2014and Delta\u2019s every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This standalone demo introduces the tone, atmosphere, and AI-driven horror of <i>Project DINOZ</i>. The mission may seem simple. The extraction won\u2019t be.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udd96 Key Features in the Demo</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play as Delta</strong><br>Take control of Delta, a recon specialist and lone survivor, as she carries out a critical recovery operation deep within enemy territory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single-Player Survival Horror Demo</strong><br>A suspenseful, cinematic experience designed as a standalone slice of the full game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2 km\u00b2 Island Sector + Underground Facility</strong><br>Navigate through an isolated region of the island and explore a tense underground segment with ambient storytelling and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intelligent Predator AI</strong><br>Encounter dinosaurs that stalk and react to your presence, creating unpredictable and immersive tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmosphere-Focused Gameplay</strong><br>No crafting or combat\u2014just you, the island, and the growing awareness that you\u2019re being hunted.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710640/extras/SS_11.png?t=1747332106\" /></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Taste of Freedom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710640/8facb94e0c397f327eef7b1c43b96045dbdb24a1.jpg"},{"name":"Wakey Wakey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710640/77e30a6c422be1f983f86362972a5062af82a8be.jpg"},{"name":"Fast Food","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710640/d5e226173f559ecbba12874ccea0dda06d06faa2.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter Zero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710640/fbdd6abac21d1316ca967f40cae339fdcf71b717.jpg"},{"name":"Tiny Terror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710640/f7c6ee975b71ceabac432e3bb3309d0ab40f9d6a.jpg"},{"name":"Ninja Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710640/02bb13e7aafa6dcdae29e831ae9931b910bd117b.jpg"},{"name":"Ninja Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710640/cf780e35de6dd2ba30a8a83c11b2e57325fe27bf.jpg"},{"name":"Book Worm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710640/96668297b6cd3808c315190b0505bbdcc3ccd0d4.jpg"},{"name":"Letters from the End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710640/86bcba9cc12aaae24a43dd544bd081c90e5116a9.jpg"},{"name":"Peace and Quiet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710640/e3051fbc2cd42b5212018a019267616c31274e29.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3710640?t=1747332106","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/ima