 Demo</strong><br>A suspenseful, cinematic experience designed as a standalone slice of the full game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2 km\u00b2 Island Sector + Underground Facility</strong><br>Navigate through an isolated region of the island and explore a tense underground segment with ambient storytelling and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intelligent Predator AI</strong><br>Encounter dinosaurs that stalk and react to your presence, creating unpredictable and immersive tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmosphere-Focused Gameplay</strong><br>No crafting or combat\u2014just you, the island, and the growing awareness that you\u2019re being hunted.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710640/extras/SS_11.png?t=1747332106\" /></p></li></ul>","developers":["Kroksy Media"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3651830","name":"Project DINOZ"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710640/434200a836440d533cdeaccdf6ae8264b4b8d30b/header.jpg?t=1747332106","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257133052,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133052/movie480.mp4?t=1747239079","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133052/movie_max.mp4?t=1747239079"},"name":"Trailer Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257133052/9fc7ad64b41a37f873da5e4d8ca6f3efbf7b49eb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747239079","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers